[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0010","text":"穿、穿上去之后\n看起来又有些不一样了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0020","text":"是吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0030","text":"……咦，那个缎带\n怎么回事？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0040","text":"啊……这、这个\n怎么都系不好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0050","text":"啊，这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0060","text":"嗯，上台的时候有造型师帮你弄，\n应该没问题的。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0070","text":"……可以让我来一下吗？\n小糸，就那样别动。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0080","text":"耶……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0090","text":"……嗯，好了。\n可能有点歪，不过感觉应该能看出来吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200100_02_0100","text":"……！\n谢、谢谢您，制作人。"}]
